+From: milouk
+Subject: [PATCH] Bluetooth: btbcm: name the BCM4358A3 UART controller
+
+The BCM4358A3 (Carlinkit U2AC, hci_uart on uart3) reports subversion 0x240f
+(001.004.015) and is missing from the UART table, so btbcm asks for brcm/BCM.hcd.
